[thin] These picks approach the rounded transverse shoulder's upper outer corner or the short storage heel around the nearby socket. The XZ shoulder is full solid stock; the YZ upper shoulder has a 3.00 mm nominal wall. These oblique corner distances are not a separate 1.73 or 2.01 mm nominal blade wall.
alternatives: A square transverse shoulder adds stock but removes the orthogonal R6 convex surface under comparison. Enlarging the heel can increase the section near the socket while changing its footprint and display seating. A solid filled upper head enlarges the wall while removing the inward round and altering its cooling.
